flowchart TB
    Flutter["Flutter Client\nClean Architecture • flutter_bloc • Dio • get_it"]

    subgraph API["UltimateSolution.API"]
        Controllers["Controllers\nAuth • Chat • Meetings • AiSummary • Notifications"]
        Middleware["Exception Middleware\nResult Envelope • JWT Auth • Swagger/OpenAPI"]
        Endpoints["SignalR Endpoint Mapping"]
    end

    subgraph Application["UltimateSolution.Application"]
        Features["CQRS / MediatR Features\nCommands • Queries • Handlers • DTOs • FluentValidation"]
        AppInterfaces["Application Interfaces\nIApplicationDbContext\nIUnitOfWork\nIMeetingMediaService\nITranscriptionService\nIAiSummaryService\nIOutboundNotificationService"]
        Contracts["Provider-neutral contracts\nMeetingMediaSession\nJoinMeetingResult\nRecordingResult"]
    end

    subgraph Domain["UltimateSolution.Domain"]
        DomainModel["Entities • Enums • Domain Exceptions\nMeeting • ChatChannel • ChatMessage\nMeetingRecording • ActionItem"]
        DomainRules["Business invariants\nNo framework or provider dependencies"]
    end

    subgraph Infrastructure["UltimateSolution.Infrastructure"]
        Persistence["Persistence\nEF Core DbContext • Repositories • Unit of Work"]
        Identity["Identity\nASP.NET Identity • JWT implementation"]
        Realtime["Realtime\nSignalR Hubs • Presence • Chat events"]
        MediaAdapter["JitsiMeetingMediaService\nOnly Jitsi SDK/API boundary"]
        AIAdapters["AI Adapters\nTranscription • Summarization • Task extraction"]
        NotificationAdapter["Notification Adapter\nIn-app now • Email extension later"]
    end

    SQL[("SQL Server")]
    Jitsi["Jitsi Media Layer"]
    AI["External AI Service\nSpeech-to-text + Summary"]
    Mail["Future Mail Provider\nNot implemented in current scope"]

    Flutter -->|HTTPS REST| Controllers
    Flutter -->|SignalR WebSocket| Endpoints
    Controllers --> Middleware
    Controllers -->|Commands / Queries| Features
    Endpoints -->|Events only| Realtime

    Features -->|uses abstractions only| AppInterfaces
    Features --> DomainModel
    Features --> Contracts
    DomainModel --> DomainRules

    Persistence -.implements.-> AppInterfaces
    Identity -.implements.-> AppInterfaces
    Realtime -.publishes domain events.-> Features
    MediaAdapter -.implements only.-> AppInterfaces
    AIAdapters -.implements.-> AppInterfaces
    NotificationAdapter -.implements.-> AppInterfaces
    Persistence --> SQL
    MediaAdapter --> Jitsi
    AIAdapters --> AI
    NotificationAdapter -.future.-> Mail

    Controllers -.host composition only.-> Infrastructure

    Note["Mandatory isolation rule\nIMeetingMediaService is defined in Application.\nJitsiMeetingMediaService exists only in Infrastructure.\nNo direct Jitsi dependency in Domain, Application, API, or Flutter."]
    AppInterfaces -.specifies.-> Note
    MediaAdapter -.conforms.-> Note

